            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The depositor provided the file 'Clientelism Perception Index_Analysis' in DTA format. DANS added the SAV and POR formats of this file.\n\nThe depositor provided the file 'ExpertSurveyElectionCampaignsIndonesia2014' in SAV and DTA formats. DANS added the POR format of this file.\n\nThe depositor provided the files 'Survey Report – Expert Survey Election Campaigns in Indonesia' and 'Variables and Sources Clientelism Perception Index_Analysis' in DOCX format. DANS converted these files to PDF/A format."
